<title>PAKISTAN: Karachi port handles 46,335 tonnes cargo.</title>
<headline>Karachi port handles 46,335 tonnes cargo.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-01-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan's Karachi Port Trust said it had handled 46,335 tonnes of export and import cargo in the 24 hours to 7 a.m. (0200 GMT) on Wednesday, compared to 114,053 tonnes on in the previous 24 hours.</p>
<p>Cargo handling in tonnes:</p>
<p>					    Wednesday	Previous</p>
<p>    Export cargo			15,269	   20,017</p>
<p>    Import cargo			31,066	   94,036</p>
<p>In the past 24 hours, 11 ship sailed and five berthed. In the next 24 hours, five ships were expected to sail and eight were expected to arrive.</p>
</text>
